<title>ARGENTINA: Argentina mandates CS First Boston to place bond.</title>
<headline>Argentina mandates CS First Boston to place bond.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Argentine government announced Monday it has selected CS First Boston to place a five year bond issue denominated in German marks.</p>
<p>The minimum amortization period will be five years, the Economy Ministry said in a press release.</p>
<p>Financial details and date of launching will be announced in coming days, it added.</p>
<p>-- Buenos Aires Newsroom, 541 318-0650</p>
</text>
